Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 12:52:12 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1047/1179] The Collection's cards: the title alone on its
 line; rename in place

1049: like, dislike and the star leave the title line (the card's lower row
carries them). A pencil by the title, and a click on the sheet's title, edit
it where it stands: Enter or leaving the field keeps it, Esc does not; the
same guard against hidden characters, 80 at most. The menu's Rename uses it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
